{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CUUGMINQeh1793313614.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國新公布的通脹數據未能紓緩市場對通脹的憂慮，金價下跌。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報4,049.7美元一盎司，跌20.5美元，跌幅百分之0.5。現貨金價曾低見4,005.47美元，跌61.88美元，跌幅百分之1.5。</p><p></p><p>美國聯儲局用作衡量通脹指標的個人消費開支物價指數PCE，9月按年升百分之3.6，按月升百分之0.5，兩個數據都較8月高0.2個百分點，雖然與市場預期相同，但反映通脹仍然上升，意味聯儲局在今年年底前仍有較大機會加息，利淡沒有利息回報的黃金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:37:40.981797+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T22:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.287660+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:35:04.062396+00:00","content_hash":"a3591f5c202d380aecab4425e736c48747598c0ff754110a6d84c994cb81670e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:37:40.981797+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}